---
// PostgreSQL Snapshot Visibility Decision Timeline Diagram Component
---

<figure class="snap-diag" aria-labelledby="snap-diag-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG Layout -->
  <svg
    class="snap-diag__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 860 300"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="snap-diag-title snap-diag-desc"
  >
    <title id="snap-diag-title">
      PostgreSQL SnapshotData 快照可見性判定時間軸
    </title>
    <desc id="snap-diag-desc">
      展示 Snapshot 格式 xmin:xmax:xip_list 在交易 XID
      遞增時間軸上如何判定早期提交交易可見、當前活躍交易不可見、以及快照建立後的未來交易不可見。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="snap-axis-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="snap-diag__axis-head"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Outer Framing Box -->
    <rect
      x="25"
      y="20"
      width="810"
      height="260"
      rx="12"
      class="snap-diag__card-bg"></rect>

    <!-- 1. Left Region: XID < xmin (Visible) (x: 45, width: 235) -->
    <g transform="translate(45, 38)">
      <rect
        width="235"
        height="74"
        rx="8"
        class="snap-diag__zone-rect snap-diag__zone-rect--green"></rect>
      <text
        x="117"
        y="26"
        class="snap-diag__zone-title snap-diag__zone-title--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        XID &lt; xmin (e.g. &lt; 100)
      </text>
      <text
        x="117"
        y="46"
        class="snap-diag__zone-desc snap-diag__zone-desc--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        早於最老活躍交易
      </text>
      <text
        x="117"
        y="62"
        class="snap-diag__zone-badge snap-diag__zone-badge--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        ✅ 必定已提交（可見）
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- 2. Mid Region: xmin <= XID < xmax (Active check) (x: 305, width: 270) -->
    <g transform="translate(305, 38)">
      <rect
        width="270"
        height="74"
        rx="8"
        class="snap-diag__zone-rect snap-diag__zone-rect--purple"></rect>
      <text
        x="135"
        y="26"
        class="snap-diag__zone-title snap-diag__zone-title--purple"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        xmin &le; XID &lt; xmax (100 ~ 107)
      </text>
      <text
        x="135"
        y="46"
        class="snap-diag__zone-desc snap-diag__zone-desc--purple"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        若在 xip [102, 105] 則活躍中（不可見）
      </text>
      <text
        x="135"
        y="62"
        class="snap-diag__zone-badge snap-diag__zone-badge--purple"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        若不在 xip 列表中 ➔ 視為已提交（可見）
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- 3. Right Region: XID >= xmax (Future) (x: 600, width: 215) -->
    <g transform="translate(600, 38)">
      <rect
        width="215"
        height="74"
        rx="8"
        class="snap-diag__zone-rect snap-diag__zone-rect--red"></rect>
      <text
        x="107"
        y="26"
        class="snap-diag__zone-title snap-diag__zone-title--red"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        XID &ge; xmax (&ge; 108)
      </text>
      <text
        x="107"
        y="46"
        class="snap-diag__zone-desc snap-diag__zone-desc--red"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        快照獲取後開啟之交易
      </text>
      <text
        x="107"
        y="62"
        class="snap-diag__zone-badge snap-diag__zone-badge--red"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        ❌ 未來事務（不可見）
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Timeline Horizontal Axis (y: 155) -->
    <line
      x1="45"
      y1="155"
      x2="795"
      y2="155"
      class="snap-diag__axis-line"
      marker-end="url(#snap-axis-arrow)"></line>
    <text x="795" y="142" class="snap-diag__axis-label" text-anchor="end"
      >交易 XID 遞增時間軸 ➔</text
    >

    <!-- Point 1: xmin = 100 Indicator (x: 290) -->
    <circle cx="290" cy="155" r="5" class="snap-diag__axis-dot"></circle>
    <line x1="290" y1="135" x2="290" y2="175" class="snap-diag__marker-line"
    ></line>
    <rect
      x="235"
      y="180"
      width="110"
      height="26"
      rx="4"
      class="snap-diag__marker-badge snap-diag__marker-badge--purple"></rect>
    <text x="290" y="197" class="snap-diag__marker-text" text-anchor="middle"
      >xmin = 100</text
    >

    <!-- Point 2: xmax = 108 Indicator (x: 590) -->
    <circle cx="590" cy="155" r="5" class="snap-diag__axis-dot"></circle>
    <line x1="590" y1="135" x2="590" y2="175" class="snap-diag__marker-line"
    ></line>
    <rect
      x="535"
      y="180"
      width="110"
      height="26"
      rx="4"
      class="snap-diag__marker-badge snap-diag__marker-badge--red"></rect>
    <text x="590" y="197" class="snap-diag__marker-text" text-anchor="middle"
      >xmax = 108</text
    >

    <!-- Bottom Snapshot Format Example Pill (y: 226) -->
    <g transform="translate(180, 224)">
      <rect width="500" height="38" rx="8" class="snap-diag__format-pill"
      ></rect>
      <text x="250" y="24" class="snap-diag__format-text" text-anchor="middle">
        Snapshot 格式範例：100:108:102,105（xmin:xmax:xip_list）
      </text>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View (Vertical Step Cards) -->
  <div class="snap-diag__mobile">
    <div class="snap-mobile-card snap-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="snap-mobile-badge snap-mobile-badge--green"
        >XID &lt; xmin (e.g. &lt; 100)</span
      >
      <h4>早期提交交易：必定可見</h4>
      <p>
        比系統當前最老的活躍交易還要早開啟，且已確定完成
        Commit，對當前快照必定可見。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="snap-mobile-arrow">↓ 邊界點：xmin = 100（最小活躍事務）</div>

    <div class="snap-mobile-card snap-mobile-card--purple">
      <span class="snap-mobile-badge snap-mobile-badge--purple"
        >xmin &le; XID &lt; xmax (100 ~ 107)</span
      >
      <h4>活躍區間校驗：查核 xip_list</h4>
      <p>
        • 若 XID 出現在 <code>xip_list: [102, 105]</code> 中：代表快照獲取瞬間<strong
          >仍未提交</strong
        >，判定不可見。
      </p>
      <p>
        • 若 XID 不在 <code>xip_list</code> 中：代表在快照產生前已成功提交，判定可見。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="snap-mobile-arrow">
      ↓ 邊界點：xmax = 108（最新分配事務 + 1）
    </div>

    <div class="snap-mobile-card snap-mobile-card--red">
      <span class="snap-mobile-badge snap-mobile-badge--red"
        >XID &ge; xmax (&ge; 108)</span
      >
      <h4>未來交易：一律不可見</h4>
      <p>
        在快照產生之後才開啟的新事務，依據快照隔離（Snapshot
        Isolation）原則，其變更對本快照絕對不可見。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="snap-mobile-card snap-mobile-card--format">
      <span class="snap-mobile-badge">SNAPSHOT STRING FORMAT</span>
      <h4>快照字串定義</h4>
      <p>
        <code>xmin:xmax:xip_list</code>（例如 <code>100:108:102,105</code
        >）以緊湊的整數陣列在記憶體中快速完成萬級 Tuple 的可見性判定。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="snap-diag-caption" class="snap-diag__caption">
    圖二：PostgreSQL SnapshotData（xmin:xmax:xip_list）可見性判定時間軸
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .snap-diag {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .snap-diag__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    background: var(--dg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }

  .snap-diag__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .snap-diag__caption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  /* SVG Base Styling */
  .snap-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  /* Region Zones */
  .snap-diag__zone-rect {
    stroke-width: 1.2;
  }

  .snap-diag__zone-rect--green {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.08);
    stroke: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .snap-diag__zone-rect--green {
    fill: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.16);
    stroke: #4ade80;
  }

  .snap-diag__zone-rect--purple {
    fill: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08);
    stroke: #8b5cf6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .snap-diag__zone-rect--purple {
    fill: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.16);
    stroke: #a78bfa;
  }

  .snap-diag__zone-rect--red {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.08);
    stroke: #dc2626;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .snap-diag__zone-rect--red {
    fill: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.16);
    stroke: #f87171;
  }

  .snap-diag__zone-title {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .snap-diag__zone-title--green {
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .snap-diag__zone-title--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .snap-diag__zone-title--purple {
    fill: #6d28d9;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .snap-diag__zone-title--purple {
    fill: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .snap-diag__zone-title--red {
    fill: #b91c1c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .snap-diag__zone-title--red {
    fill: #fca5a5;
  }

  .snap-diag__zone-desc {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .snap-diag__zone-desc--green {
    fill: #166534;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .snap-diag__zone-desc--green {
    fill: #bbf7d0;
  }

  .snap-diag__zone-desc--purple {
    fill: #5b21b6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .snap-diag__zone-desc--purple {
    fill: #ddd6fe;
  }

  .snap-diag__zone-desc--red {
    fill: #991b1b;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .snap-diag__zone-desc--red {
    fill: #fecaca;
  }

  .snap-diag__zone-badge {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .snap-diag__zone-badge--green {
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .snap-diag__zone-badge--green {
    fill: #4ade80;
  }

  .snap-diag__zone-badge--purple {
    fill: #6d28d9;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .snap-diag__zone-badge--purple {
    fill: #c084fc;
  }

  .snap-diag__zone-badge--red {
    fill: #dc2626;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .snap-diag__zone-badge--red {
    fill: #f87171;
  }

  /* Axis Lines */
  .snap-diag__axis-line {
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 2.5;
  }

  .snap-diag__axis-head {
    fill: var(--dg-rule-strong);
  }

  .snap-diag__axis-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  .snap-diag__axis-dot {
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  .snap-diag__marker-line {
    stroke: var(--dg-ink);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .snap-diag__marker-badge {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .snap-diag__marker-badge--purple {
    stroke: #8b5cf6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .snap-diag__marker-badge--purple {
    stroke: #a78bfa;
  }

  .snap-diag__marker-badge--red {
    stroke: #dc2626;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .snap-diag__marker-badge--red {
    stroke: #f87171;
  }

  .snap-diag__marker-text {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  /* Format Pill */
  .snap-diag__format-pill {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 1.2;
  }

  .snap-diag__format-text {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  /* Responsive Mobile Styling */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .snap-diag__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .snap-diag__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.875rem;
    }

    .snap-mobile-card {
      background: var(--dg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: 1rem 1.125rem;
    }

    .snap-mobile-card--green {
      border-left: 4px solid #16a34a;
      background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.04);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .snap-mobile-card--green {
      background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.12);
      border-color: #4ade80;
    }

    .snap-mobile-card--purple {
      border-left: 4px solid #8b5cf6;
      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.04);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .snap-mobile-card--purple {
      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.12);
      border-color: #a78bfa;
    }

    .snap-mobile-card--red {
      border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
      background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.04);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .snap-mobile-card--red {
      background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.12);
      border-color: #f87171;
    }

    .snap-mobile-card--format {
      background: var(--dg-surface-2);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--dg-rule-strong);
    }

    .snap-mobile-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    }

    .snap-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #16a34a;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .snap-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #86efac;
    }

    .snap-mobile-badge--purple {
      color: #8b5cf6;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .snap-mobile-badge--purple {
      color: #c4b5fd;
    }

    .snap-mobile-badge--red {
      color: #dc2626;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .snap-mobile-badge--red {
      color: #fca5a5;
    }

    .snap-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }

    .snap-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0.2rem 0;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .snap-mobile-card code {
      font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      background: var(--dg-surface-2);
      padding: 0.1rem 0.3rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .snap-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      padding: 0.125rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
